+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011v9gpqfc2ffp5556JJBhHd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 3: Priority\n2\t\n3\tAdd priority support to tasks.\n4\t\n5\t## Updated Methods\n6\t\n7\t- **`enqueue(queueName, payload, options?)`** - The options object can include `priority`.\n8\t  - `priority`: number from 1 (highest) to 10 (lowest). Default is 5.\n9\t\n10\t## Requirements\n11\t\n12\t- `dequeue()` returns the highest priority task first (lowest number = highest priority)\n13\t- Within the same priority level, FIFO order is preserved\n14\t- Default priority is 5 if not specified\n15\t- Priority values outside 1-10 should throw an error\n16\t- Priority is per-queue (each named queue has its own priority ordering)\n17\t- The task object should include a `priority` property\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RHRBicVF9uaSx2wJ5fEg5h","session_id":"0f122924-a0ea-4945-8ed2-52b5e52c9c41","uuid":"4ff65087-a44e-48fa-878e-fe0ac289be9a","timestamp":"2026-06-30T20:58:48.681Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore project structure"}
